    },
    "The mosaic could not start." : {
      "comment" : "Alert title when full screen fails",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile avviare il mosaico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most recent photographs stay the same: a change picks other photographs only when they are random or spread over time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le foto più recenti restano le stesse: un cambio sceglie altre foto solo se sono a caso o distribuite nel tempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photographs shown full screen, one in sixteen, are chosen from your whole library, and Mosaic Companion downloads a sharp copy of each that this Mac lacks, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %lld a day and %lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. Photos keeps them in your library until it needs the space." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, Download from iCloud: what Sharp close-ups only means",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The photographs shown full screen, one in sixteen, are chosen from your whole library, and Mosaic Companion downloads a sharp copy of each that this Mac lacks, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %1$lld a day and %2$lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. Photos keeps them in your library until it needs the space."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le foto mostrate a tutto schermo, una su sedici, sono scelte da tutta la libreria, e Mosaic Companion scarica una copia nitida di ognuna che manca su questo Mac, di circa 1,3 MB, mai l’originale: al massimo %lld al giorno e %lld alla settimana, e nessuna su un hotspot o con Consumo limitato di dati. Foto conserva le copie nella libreria finché non le serve lo spazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photographs shown full screen, one in sixteen, are chosen from your whole library, and Mosaic Companion downloads a sharp copy of each that this Mac lacks, and of up to %lld of the photographs shown large around them, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %lld a day and %lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. Photos keeps them in your library until it needs the space." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, Download from iCloud: what Sharp close-ups only means, when tiles around them are downloaded too",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The photographs shown full screen, one in sixteen, are chosen from your whole library, and Mosaic Companion downloads a sharp copy of each that this Mac lacks, and of up to %1$lld of the photographs shown large around them, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %2$lld a day and %3$lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. Photos keeps them in your library until it needs the space."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le foto mostrate a tutto schermo, una su sedici, sono scelte da tutta la libreria, e Mosaic Companion scarica una copia nitida di ognuna che manca su questo Mac, e di fino a %1$lld delle foto mostrate in grande intorno a loro, di circa 1,3 MB, mai l’originale: al massimo %2$lld al giorno e %3$lld alla settimana, e nessuna su un hotspot o con Consumo limitato di dati. Foto conserva le copie nella libreria finché non le serve lo spazio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen saver asked for photographs (%@)." : {
      "comment" : "The reason in parentheses is a code the screen saver sends, such as no-index",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salvaschermo ha chiesto le foto (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen saver could not be installed: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Followed by the reason, as macOS words it",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile installare il salvaschermo: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen saver could not be updated: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Followed by the reason, as macOS words it",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile aggiornare il salvaschermo: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen saver is not installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salvaschermo non è installato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen saver won't pick up new photographs until you next log in." : {
      "comment" : "Quit alert",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salvaschermo non riceverà nuove foto fino al prossimo login."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They never leave this Mac: Mosaic Companion keeps a small copy of each, to build the mosaics from. Which albums, and how many photographs, are in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non lasciano mai questo Mac: Mosaic Companion ne tiene una piccola copia, con cui comporre i mosaici. Quali album e quante foto si scelgono in Impostazioni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build carries no screen saver." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa build non contiene il salvaschermo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This matters only if your Photos library keeps its originals in iCloud. Then Mosaic Companion can download a sharp copy of the photographs it shows full screen, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %lld a day and %lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. With Nothing, Mosaic Companion tells you in its window if some close-ups turn out blurry. You can change this in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This matters only if your Photos library keeps its originals in iCloud. Then Mosaic Companion can download a sharp copy of the photographs it shows full screen, about 1.3 MB each, never the original: at most %1$lld a day and %2$lld a week, and none on a hotspot or in Low Data Mode. With Nothing, Mosaic Companion tells you in its window if some close-ups turn out blurry. You can change this in Settings."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conta solo se la tua libreria di Foto tiene gli originali su iCloud. In quel caso Mosaic Companion può scaricare una copia nitida delle foto che mostra a tutto schermo, di circa 1,3 MB, mai l’originale: al massimo %lld al giorno e %lld alla settimana, e nessuna su un hotspot o con Consumo limitato di dati. Con Niente, Mosaic Companion ti avvisa nella sua finestra se alcuni primi piani risultano sfocati. Puoi cambiare questa scelta in Impostazioni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Mosaic Companion on under Photos, then reopen it: the access starts with the next launch. A folder of photographs works too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attiva Mosaic Companion in Foto, poi riaprilo: l’accesso vale dall’avvio successivo. Va bene anche una cartella di foto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
